<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title><%= table_name %> – Grid Editor</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0b1020;
        --panel: #101a33;
        --text: #e8ecff;
        --muted: #aeb7e6;
        --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        --good: #2dd4bf;
        --bad: #fb7185;
        --warn: #fbbf24;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, "Apple Color Emoji",
          "Segoe UI Emoji";
        background: radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 10% 0%, #172554 0%, var(--bg) 55%);
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .wrap { padding: 18px 18px 28px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .top {
        display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2px; }
      .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
      .pill {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(16, 26, 51, 0.6);
        font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted);
      }
      .status-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--muted); }
      .status-dot.saving { background: var(--warn); }
      .status-dot.ok { background: var(--good); }
      .status-dot.err { background: var(--bad); }

      .card {
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(16, 26, 51, 0.55);
        border-radius: 14px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      }
      .table-wrap { overflow: auto; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 760px; }
      thead th {
        position: sticky; top: 0;
        background: rgba(16, 26, 51, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        text-align: left; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 10px 10px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      tbody td {
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        padding: 8px 10px;
        vertical-align: top;
        font-size: 13px;
      }
      tbody tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
      td.pk {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      td[data-col] {
        outline: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      td[data-col][contenteditable="true"]:focus {
        background: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.08);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.35);
      }
      td.saving {
        background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.30);
      }
      td.saved {
        background: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.10);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.30);
      }
      td.error {
        background: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.10);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.35);
      }
      .hint {
        margin-top: 10px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body data-table="<%= table_name %>" data-pk="<%= primary_key %>">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="top">
        <div>
          <h1>Postgres Grid Editor</h1>
          <div class="sub">
            Tabelle: <code><%= table_name %></code> · Primary Key: <code><%= primary_key %></code>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pill" id="saveStatus" title="Speicherstatus">
          <span class="status-dot" id="saveDot"></span>
          <span id="saveText">bereit</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%= yield %>

      <div class="hint">
        Tipp: Zelle anklicken → ändern → Fokus verlassen (oder Enter) speichert. Für komplexe Eingaben kannst du auch
        über „Edit“-Link in die Formularansicht.
      </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/app.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
